            <rs type="work" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:4922">grub pa'i mtha' <lb edRef="inst:5843" n="73a9"/> rnaM par dbye ba rgyan gyi me tog</rs> <note type="editorial">In ID:4921 par dbye is unreadable due to damage/smudging</note> <lb edRef="inst:4921" n="114a9"/> ces bya <app><lem wit="inst:5843">ba |</lem><rdg wit="inst:5843">ba |</rdg><rdg wit="inst:4921">ba</rdg></app> rang dang gzhan gyi grub pa'i mtha' rgya mtsho lta bu la blo'i nyi ma'i 'od gsal <app><lem wit="inst:5843">ba ¦</lem><rdg wit="inst:5843">ba ¦</rdg><rdg wit="inst:4921">ba</rdg></app> <rs type="person" ana="corpusmd:named_reference" ref="db:4006">mang du thos pa'i <lb edRef="inst:4921" n="114a10"/> dge slong bcoM ldan ral gri</rs>s sbyar ba <app><lem wit="inst:5843">'di rdzogs s+h+yo || ¦¦ ||</lem><rdg wit="inst:5843">'di rdzogs s+h+yo || ¦¦ ||</rdg><rdg wit="inst:4921">'di ¦ rdzogs s+hyo ||</rdg></app> <lb edRef="inst:5843" n="73a10"/> dge'o || <note type="editorial">In ID:5843 there's something written before dge'o - only the vowel markers are clear. It could be 'zhus yod pa'i legs so'</note> <app><lem wit="inst:4921">zhu dag | ||</lem><rdg wit="inst:5843"/><rdg wit="inst:4921">zhu dag | ||</rdg></app> <note type="editorial">zhu dag is obscured due to damage/smudging. It could be an abbreviated form of 'zhu dag byed'</note></seg></ab>

         <ab type="variant">
         <seg type="excerpt" xml:id="ex61132023-09-09-12.05" status="finalized" ana="corpusmd:colophon">
